# INVWINRC.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the item listing
# printed on Windows' default printer, its Output turned from SCREEN,
# the first offered, to PRINTER, with PAGE20.CFG's pages of 20 lines,
# and the box that says it is done; the end by Exit.
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINRC.SNP is its snapshot, and
# TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINRC.PRN what the test machine's printer, Generic /
# Text Only on a file, prints.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-R I ALT-O DOWN
K ENTER
S PRINTED
K ENTER
S AGAIN
K ESC
K ALT-F X
